    "C": "Second and fourth quadrants; within each quadrant, \\(y\\) decreases as \\(x\\) increases.",
    "D": "First and third quadrants; within each quadrant, \\(y\\) increases as \\(x\\) increases."
  },
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
